===Etymology===
From {{OE.}} ''[[hæþen]]''.

===Pronunciation===
*:Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-iːðən|-iːðən]]

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# not adhering to an [[w:Abrahamic religion|Abrahamic religion]]
# relating to the religion Heathenry, a modern pagan faith inspired by the pre-christian religions of the Germanic tribes, Anglo-Saxons and Norse peoples.

